 "details": {
  "title": "Stardust",
  "lead": "The trumpet track's Stardust, written out again by hand: Carmichael's verse in C, then straight into the chorus a half step up in D♭, the way the player takes it. His turns, runs and octave leaps are kept. Where the track loses the trumpet, the written tune fills in. Concert G3 to G5."
 }
